📊 Region-Wise Analysis & Deep Dive Analysis

Project Overview
This Tableau project analyzes **Sample Superstore Orders and Returns data to evaluate business performance across the Central, East, South and West regions. The project is designed to provide stakeholders with an interactive view of sales, profit, customers, orders, quantity, discounts, products, sub-categories and returns, helping identify regional performance differences and key business trends.

🔍 Analysis Covered
Region-Wise Analysis
Provides a high-level comparison of the four regions using key performance indicators and interactive visualizations to evaluate:
	Sales and Profit
	Customers and Orders
	Products and Quantity
	Discounts and Returns
	Regional and sub-category performance
	Quarterly sales trends

Deep Dive Analysis
Provides a more detailed exploration of regional performance by analyzing:
	Top 5 sub-categories by Sales and Profit
	Monthly Sales and Profit trends
	Monthly Quantity, Discounts, Orders and Returns
	Top-performing products


	Product-level Sales, Profit, Quantity, Discount, and Order analysis
	Regional comparisons and drill-down insights

🎯 Business Objective
The objective is to move from high-level regional reporting to **actionable business insights** by identifying high- and low-performing regions, products, sub-categories, and time periods. The analysis can support decisions related to product strategy, regional planning, inventory, promotions, profitability and future business forecasting.

